# Feature correlation, MADOS train split (annotated pixels)

761,887 pixels with the 26 features. Heatmaps are ordered by hierarchical clustering on 1 − |Spearman ρ| (the all-classes order is used for every heatmap, so they can be compared), tick colours show the feature group, and every cell shows ρ. Strongly correlated features carry largely the same information, so SHAP can split credit between them; read feature importance together with these clusters and with the grouped results.

